flowchart TD
    human["Buyer / merchant / operator<br/>OIDC session; step-up for sensitive roles"]
    web["Public edge<br/>WAF / request limits / CSRF / CSP"]
    auth["Domain authorization<br/>object + property + function checks<br/>tenant-scoped queries and RLS defense"]
    policy["PayGuard<br/>version-bound approval<br/>budget / expiry / material-term checks"]
    egress["Payment adapter / secrets<br/>fixed PayPal hosts and scoped credentials<br/>no model or test-runtime access"]
    vault["Secrets manager / KMS<br/>rotation / access audit"]
    db["Authoritative SQL<br/>least-privilege roles / encryption<br/>backup and restore checks"]
    untrusted["Product pages / API output / uploads<br/>allowlisted acquisition + size limits<br/>SSRF defenses and malware checks"]
    model["Astropods model stage<br/>structured proposals only<br/>no credentials or arbitrary execution"]
    validator["Fact and constraint validation<br/>critical unknowns stay unresolved<br/>accepted evidence retains provenance"]
    pp["PayPal<br/>provider authentication + payment"]
    hook["Webhook verifier<br/>raw bytes / app binding / inbox dedupe"]
    test["Counterexample environment<br/>separate secrets / DB / namespace<br/>sandbox-only endpoint policy"]
    human --> web
    web --> auth
    auth --> policy
    policy --> db
    policy -->|approved durable operation| egress
    vault -->|scoped secret| egress
    egress --> pp
    untrusted -->|data only| model
    model --> validator
    validator -->|proposed facts, never permission| auth
    pp -.->|signed event| hook
    hook -->|verified durable inbox| db
    test -.->|owned test target only| web
